Subject: [PATCH] glamor: do not require texture_border_clamp on GLES (ANGLE)

ANGLE-Metal does not advertise GL_OES_texture_border_clamp; glamor only
uses it for rarely needed repeat/clamp-to-border cases. Warn and continue,
as the 23.2 port did.

diff -ruN xwayland-24.1.13/glamor/glamor.c xwayland-24.1.13.patched/glamor/glamor.c
--- xwayland-24.1.13/glamor/glamor.c
+++ xwayland-24.1.13.patched/glamor/glamor.c
@@ -721,9 +721,10 @@
             goto fail;
         }
 
-        if (!epoxy_has_gl_extension("GL_OES_texture_border_clamp")) {
-            ErrorF("GL_OES_texture_border_clamp required\n");
-            goto fail;
+        if (!epoxy_has_gl_extension("GL_OES_texture_border_clamp") &&
+            !epoxy_has_gl_extension("GL_EXT_texture_border_clamp")) {
+            LogMessageVerb(X_WARNING, 0,
+                           "glamor/iosurface: no texture_border_clamp; continuing\n");
         }
     }
 
